Yes! Hiring an experienced California lemon law lawyer with proven results in the Lincoln buyback program is the smartest decision you will make in the process. Even if you believe your case is rock solid, there are no guarantees of compensation.

Lincoln has high-powered defense teams to avoid lemon law buybacks - earning fair compensation without professional legal counsel will be nearly impossible. It doesn’t matter if your vehicle clearly meets the qualifications of Lincoln lemon law, the company has no intention of taking responsibility for its own mistakes.

